{
  "info": {
    "name": "System Cukierniczy v3 — DynamoDB + RDS + AWS Integration",
    "description": "Testy REST API dla systemu v3 z AWS bazami danych.\n\nCo testujemy:\n- Health checks wszystkich 5 serwisów\n- AWS DynamoDB integracja (design_service, notification_service)\n- AWS RDS (PostgreSQL) integracja (inventory_service, order_service, payment_service)\n- Testy negatywne (walidacja danych)\n- Pełny flow zamówienia z persistence w AWS bazie\n- CRUD operacje z weryfikacją zapisania w AWS\n- AWS connection logging\n\nPorty:\n- OrderService:        http://localhost:8001 (RDS PostgreSQL)\n- DesignService:       http://localhost:8002 (DynamoDB)\n- InventoryService:    http://localhost:8003 (RDS PostgreSQL)\n- PaymentService:      http://localhost:8004 (RDS PostgreSQL)\n- NotificationService: http://localhost:8005 (DynamoDB)\n\nAWS Databases:\n- DynamoDB: design_files, notifications tables\n- RDS: inventory_db, order_db, payment_db PostgreSQL databases",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "design_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "payment_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ingredient_name", "value": "mąka", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "order_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "design_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8002", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "inventory_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8003", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "payment_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8004", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_service_url", "value": "http://localhost:8005", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
